  "text": "I don't have any external tools available in this conversation. I'm a standard text-based AI assistant, which means I can:\n\n## What I Can Do Natively:\n- **Answer questions** on a wide range of topics\n- **Write & edit** text, essays, code, emails, etc.\n- **Analyze & summarize** text you share with me\n- **Math & reasoning** (basic to intermediate calculations)\n- **Brainstorming** ideas and problem-solving\n- **Translation** (many languages)\n- **Explain concepts** in simple or technical terms\n\n## What I *Cannot* Do (No Tools Available):\n- 🔍 **Search the internet** (no web browsing)\n- 📁 **Access files/documents** (unless you paste the text)\n- 🖼️ **Generate images**\n- 📊 **Run code or execute programs**\n- 🌐 **Access real-time data** (news, weather, stock prices, etc.)\n- 📅 **Know events after my knowledge cutoff**\n\n---\n\nIf you're using a platform that has given me tools (like web search, code execution, etc.), those would typically be listed in my system configuration — but none are present here.\n\n**How can I help you today?** 😊",
  "type": "text"
 }
